# ======================================================================
# SPARXSTAR EVENT HORIZON — High-Risk Geo Map
# Operators: edit this file to customise the high-risk country list.
# Each entry is a two-letter ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code (the value
# sent by Cloudflare in the CF-IPCountry header) followed by " 1;".
#
# IMPORTANT: geo=1 alone NEVER triggers a block.  It acts as a RISK
# AMPLIFIER — a request is blocked only when BOTH the country code
# appears here AND another threat signal (SQLi, bad bot, etc.) fires.
#
# Deployment: copy to /etc/nginx/maps/high-risk-geo.map
# Reload after editing:  sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx
# ======================================================================

NG      1;  # Nigeria
GH      1;  # Ghana
